{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/micro_intro2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Microtopia you'll manage a colony of robot ants, design a network of transport trails, explore unique environments and expand your settlement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? To reproduce! Create young queens that will fly out during the nuptial flight to spread out to distant lands. Starting the cycle anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1742373369\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/micro_features2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your queen to start a colony. Navigate a world of electronic waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use trails and buildings to create instructions for your ants. Collect materials, produce goods and feed the queen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your layout by using sensors and logic gates to sort your ants based on different properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your workers into different castes like flying ants, digger ants and inventor ants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a tech tree to unlock new features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony and fly out to nearby islands. Explore a vast array of colorful biomes, discover new plant species and find ways to use their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reproduce<strong>: </strong>As with all life; your goal is to reproduce! Gather up enough resources to build young queens to let them fly out and start new colonies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ant of the Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/d9280b3d8620f4a2bd298cfe36b99f9d1c1be453.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Ant Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/b67aa16ef87c946a139d04ce6e187f1f45fb3a53.jpg"},{"name":"Scrahara Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/986aad1c9d9bdd4e8585c488122e86fec6ac6259.jpg"},{"name":"Static Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/be37cd4f81080c296c277cc31d2d38ff1eadfda7.jpg"},{"name":"Toxic Wasteland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/d76dd955bcf288baa04a7fa9e035e2858d8a5ce6.jpg"},{"name":"Concrete Fields","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/4775fbcbdea4519aec7dba13b409d99a0f73fc13.jpg"},{"name":"Ant Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/3c7884ee8e6f0b62a71a7c95eebf3707d523c5c5.jpg"},{"name":"Mega Colony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/6e5b10ce6f1df96fa0712727e2140ae9eb267c20.jpg"},{"name":"Reproduction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/12b223256e2fdaa9bac59043f0b7ce29f8a41976.jpg"},{"name":"Metamorphosis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2750000/ab77d4a17efda29a5f9d8f5f9036690d26d9c2ff.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2750000?t=1742373369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2750000?t=1742373369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742373369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742373369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/JoinOurDiscord.png?t=1742373369\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/micro_intro2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Microtopia you'll manage a colony of robot ants, design a network of transport trails, explore unique environments and expand your settlement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? To reproduce! Create young queens that will fly out during the nuptial flight to spread out to distant lands. Starting the cycle anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1742373369\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/micro_features2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your queen to start a colony. Navigate a world of electronic waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use trails and buildings to create instructions for your ants. Collect materials, produce goods and feed the queen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your layout by using sensors and logic gates to sort your ants based on different properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your workers into different castes like flying ants, digger ants and inventor ants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a tech tree to unlock new features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony and fly out to nearby islands. Explore a vast array of colorful biomes, discover new plant species and find ways to use their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reproduce<strong>: </strong>As with all life; your goal is to reproduce! Gather up enough resources to build young queens to let them fly out and start new colonies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750000/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1742373369\" /></p>","developers":["Cordyceps Collective"],"dlc":[3509030],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":